{"id":575,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"On nights when the stars shine, this Pokémon’s psychic power is at its strongest. It’s unknown just what link Gothorita has to the greater universe."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It’s said that when stars shine in the night sky, this Pokémon will spirit away sleeping children. Some call it the Witch of Punishment."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"According to many old tales, it creates friends for itself by controlling sleeping children on starry nights."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White"],"text":"Starlight is the source of their power. At night, they mark star positions by using psychic power to float stones."},{"games":["Black"],"text":"They use hypnosis to control people and Pokémon. Tales of Gothorita leading people astray are told in every corner."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Frisk","hidden":false,"description":"When it enters a battle, the Pokémon can check an opposing Pokémon's held item."},{"name":"Competitive","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Sp. Atk stat sharply when its stats are lowered by an opposing Pokémon."},{"name":"Shadow Tag","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon steps on the opposing Pokémon's shadows to prevent them from fleeing or switching out."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like"],"genderRate":6,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Purple","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":574,"name":"Gothita","condition":null,"children":[{"id":575,"name":"Gothorita","condition":"Lv. 32","children":[{"id":576,"name":"Gothitelle","condition":"Lv. 41","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,1],[1,93],[1,321],[1,589],[12,60],[16,204],[20,473],[24,95],[28,313],[35,244],[46,260],[52,248],[58,478]],"machine":[347,204,399,203,412,797,263,313,374,492,248,447,356,270,286,113,118,417,182,60,244,94,917,678,473,240,115,156,157,317,247,285,214,500,164,129,269,851,168,86,85,271,433,428],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"